From 27d7ed126e7aa6f7bde43c50e96c5db5b01fb62e Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: zhengguangchun <zhengguangchun@metastonecorp.com>
Date: Thu, 8 Oct 2026 18:53:38 +0800
Subject: [PATCH] [riscv64] add ATen/c10/caffe2 HIP backend sources for ROCm
 port

Add 683 HIP backend adaptation sources:
- aten/src/ATen: hip/ + native/hip/ + native/cudnn/hip/ kernels
- c10/hip: driver_api, HIPStream, PeerToPeerAccess, impl, test
- caffe2: core/hip, serialize/hip, utils/hip + threadpool
- test/cpp/c10d

Excludes torch/lib/aotriton.images/ (154M built aotriton kernel
images, reproducible via aotriton source build; now gitignored).

Completes the riscv/2.13.0-port tree for TheRock 10.0 RISC-V stack.

