+   * Generally the approach for q, k, v is to
+   * (1) get the storage of the contiguous nested tensor
+   * (2) view as shape {output_batch_size, {*}_t.size(1), output_num_heads,
+   * head_dim_{*}}, and stride {0, nnz_{*}_stride, head_{*}_stride,
